<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Welcome to Engine</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px;">
    <h1 style="color: #333;">Hi {{ recipientName }},</h1>

    <p>Welcome to Engine! Your account has been created successfully.</p>

    <p>To activate your account and get started, please click the link below:</p>

    <p>
        <a href="{{ activationUrl }}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background: #0066cc; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px;">
            Activate your account
        </a>
    </p>

    <p style="color: #666; font-size: 12px;">
        If the button above doesn't work, copy and paste this URL into your browser:<br>
        {{ activationUrl }}
    </p>

    <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; margin: 24px 0;">

    <p style="color: #999; font-size: 12px;">
        This message was sent to {{ recipientName }} from the Engine mail template demo.
    </p>
</body>
</html>
